@startuml SD09_OfflineReplay
!include _style.iuml
title SD-09  Replay saved frames offline (UC-17) — REQ-42, REQ-61

actor Imager
participant ":Program" as P
participant ":SettingsStore" as Store
participant ":FrameCatalog" as Cat
participant ":FrameAnalyser" as An
participant ":SkiaFrameDecoder" as Dec
participant ":SkyFrameCheck" as SF
participant ":TargetGrid" as Grid
participant ":CloudDetector" as CD
participant ":ReviewSelector" as Sel
participant ":AnnotatedFrameWriter" as Ann
participant ":ResultsCsvWriter" as Csv
participant ":ReviewWorkbookWriter" as Wb

Imager -> P : Harness replay ~-~-frames ~~/AllskyFrames ~-~-settings settings.json ~-~-out ~~/Replay/run1
P -> Store : Load(settings.json)
Store --> P : lens, working area, thresholds (copied from the AstroPC)
P -> Cat : List(options)
Cat --> P : frames in time order: night folders yyyyMMdd,\n*-yyyyMMddHHmmss.jpg, every StepS [60 s]
loop each frame
  P -> An : Analyse(frame)
  An -> An : Sun altitude (CoreAstroCalculator)
  alt Sun above the limit
    An --> P : skipped (daylight)
  else night
    An -> Dec : Decode(jpeg)
    Dec --> An : GrayFrame (darkest channel)
    An -> SF : Evaluate(frame, area, lens)
    alt not a sky frame
      An --> P : FrameResult (no targets)
    else sky frame
      An -> Grid : RoisAt(utc, site, settings)
      Grid --> An : ROIs of targets with ≥ 50% inside the working area
      loop each target
        An -> CD : Assess(frame, roi, …, moon, reference)
        CD --> An : CloudAssessment (+ captured reference, first clear frame)
      end
      An --> P : FrameResult
    end
  end
  P -> Csv : Append(result)  (every row)
  P -> Sel : Select(result)
  Sel --> P : verdict changed / near a limit
  opt selected
    P -> Ann : Write(frame, target, why)
    Ann --> P : review/<night>/<time>-<target>.jpg
    P -> Wb : Add(row, image)
  end
end
P -> Wb : Save(review.xlsx)
P --> Imager : results.csv, review.xlsx, review images, summary on the console
note over Imager, Wb : The imager opens review.xlsx in Excel, clicks each link,\nenters My verdict; the Summary sheet counts agreement (REQ-61).\nRe-run with changed thresholds to compare.
@enduml
